#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Corundum, Al2O3 (R -3 c, No. 167, hexagonal axes), with no listed
# operations and no Hermann-Mauguin symbol: only the Hall symbol -R 3 2"c,
# whose double prime the symmetry library spells differently. The importer
# must generate the 36 operations from it (it used to panic).
# Hand-written test fixture for Materials Workbench (mw-crystal-io). Values
# are commonly cited literature parameters, typed in by hand; nothing is
# copied from a database.
#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

data_corundum_hall
_chemical_formula_sum             'Al2 O3'
_symmetry_space_group_name_Hall   '-R 3 2"c'
_cell_length_a                    4.7589
_cell_length_b                    4.7589
_cell_length_c                    12.991
_cell_angle_alpha                 90
_cell_angle_beta                  90
_cell_angle_gamma                 120
loop_
_atom_site_label
_atom_site_type_symbol
_atom_site_fract_x
_atom_site_fract_y
_atom_site_fract_z
Al1 Al 0 0 0.35216
O1 O 0.30624 0 0.25
